/repos/apache/airflow/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/deployments","created_at":"2015-04-13T18:04:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:15Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-29T14:43:56Z","git_url":"git://github.com/apache/airflow.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:apache/airflow.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow","homepage":"https://airflow.apache.org/","size":790917,"stargazers_count":47308,"watchers_count":47308,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":18214,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1927,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["airflow","apache","apache-airflow","automation","dag","data-engineering","data-integration","data-orchestrator","data-pipelines","data-science","elt","etl","machine-learning","mlops","orchestration","python","scheduler","workflow","workflow-engine","workflow-orchestration"],"visibility":"public","forks":18214,"open_issues":1927,"watchers":47308,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls/74374","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/74374","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/74374.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/74374.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n     https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 -->\n\n`_schedule_all_dag_runs` catches per-run scheduling errors so one bad DAG run cannot stop the\nothers. The `except` block logs with `run.run_id` and `run.dag_id`, read from the same object that\njust failed. If the scheduling call detached that run from the session, the read raises\n`DetachedInstanceError` from inside the handler. The handler does not catch it, so the exception\nescapes `_schedule_all_dag_runs` and the scheduler process exits.\n\nThis is the failure mode reported in #73311, where the crash is reached via\n`TaskMap.expand_mapped_task`. The handler itself can also raise, which turns any detached-run error\ninto a scheduler crash.\n\nThis change reads `run_id` and `dag_id` before the `try` block, while the run is still attached,\nand logs those values in the handler. Nothing else changes.\n\nRegression test: `test_schedule_all_dag_runs_error_handler_survives_detached_dag_run` detaches the\nrun inside `_schedule_dag_run`, then asserts `_schedule_all_dag_runs` returns normally. It fails on\n`main` with `DetachedInstanceError` escaping the handler, and passes with this change.\n\nNot verified: the existing `test_schedule_all_dag_runs_does_not_crash_on_single_dag_run_error`, which\ncovers the same loop, could not run in the local sandbox because of a `ModuleNotFoundError: airflow_shared`\nin a logging-capture fixture. CI will run it. `ruff check` and `ruff format --check` are clean. Breeze\nand mypy were not run locally.\n\nRelated: #73311 (open, no linked PR). This PR does not fix the underlying session-expiry in\n`expand_mapped_task`; it only stops the handler from turning that error into a crash.\n\n---\n\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\n\n- [X] Yes (please specify the tool below)\n\n<!--\nGenerated-by: Claude Code following [the guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#gen-ai-assisted-contributions)\n-->\n\nClaude Code was used to read the issue and code, reproduce the failure with a test, implement the\nchange, and run the tests and linters. The diff and results were reviewed before submission.\n\n---\n\n* Read the [Pull Request Guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#pull-request-guidelines).\n* Relates to #73311.\n* Newsfragment (`{pr_number}.bugfix.rst`) will be added as a follow-up commit once the PR number is known.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/74374/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/74374/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]
